@startuml Sum_Ssfm_DTCU1961_Handler
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho

legend top left
    "Sum_Ssfm_DTCU1961_Handler"

**Interfaces Legend**
   //II152 //: ERRH_ExecutionStatus
   //ri117 //: ISPKSP
   //II159 //: Debounced Error
   //II150 //: BatteryVoltage 
   //II156 //: isTransportMode
   //II157 //: DisableDTCs
   //II164 //: isGeneralSequenceOrMemoryFail
   //pi131 //: DTC_1961_SecurityPeripheralPerformance_SetEventStatus
   //II160 //: Undebounced Error
   
endlegend

note top of EC
is responsible for asking the DEM to set the DTC 1961 according to what has been verified by the Secp Errors Aggregator.
end note


component [SSFM::Sum_Ssfm_DTCU1961_Handler] as EC{
	portin ri117
    portout pi131

	[Sum_Ssfm_DTCU1961_Handler]  as E
}
   interface II152
   interface II159
   interface II150
   interface II156
   interface II157
   interface II164
   interface II160



  II152 -> E
  ri117 -> E
  II159 -> E
  II150 -> E
  II156 -> E
  II157 -> E
  II164 -> E
  E -> pi131
  E -> II160  


@enduml
